      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i just found out i have hyperthyroidism like my doctor said i have an overactive thyroid so i'm feeling kinda wired and fast heart rate all the time. i've been on adderall for my adhd for a while now but i'm worried if i take it today it's gonna make the jitters way worse. is it okay to keep taking my regular dose or should i do something else?",
