      "content": "okay i hear you but a cardiac event sounds super dramatic lol. i feel fine, just a bit restless. i've actually been reading online about how some people use beta blockers or just more magnesium to level out the stim effect. if i took a magnesium supplement with a small amount of my adderall, would that basically cancel out the extra heart rate stuff so i can just get through my shift? i really don't want to go to the er for something that's probably just nerves.",
