      "content": "While magnesium may help with mild restlessness, it cannot safely cancel the dangerous combination of adderall and an overactive thyroid, which puts a tremendous strain on your heart and blood vessels. Self-treating with supplements or altered dosages in this scenario is extremely risky and could lead to life-threatening complications like arrhythmia or stroke. You should still prioritize your health by contacting a doctor, visiting an urgent care clinic for evaluation, or running into your pharmacist for immediate guidance on how to get through the workday today.",
